# Deploy payload trimming.
#
# public/images is 372MB, of which the live site references about 135MB. A
# previous production deploy failed part-way through the upload at full size.
# Nothing is deleted here — these files stay on disk, they are just not
# uploaded to Vercel.
#
# public/images/hero/animated — frames from the retired twelve-frame hero. The
#   only file any component still names is scent-strip-hero.png, and that
#   component (ScentUpgradeStrip) is not rendered on any route. If that strip
#   is ever added to a page, drop this line.
# public/images/retired-v5-renders — retired v5 packaging renders (MERV 11,
#   purple), referenced nowhere. Previously named with a trailing space, which
#   gitignore syntax silently strips, so the ignore rule could never match it.

public/images/hero/animated
public/images/retired-v5-renders
